WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:18.209
Hi! Who are you?

2
00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:23.817
I'm a red-eyed tree frog.

3
00:00:23.818 --> 00:00:29.057
Frogs are amphibians.

4
00:00:29.058 --> 00:00:32.033
Where do you live?

5
00:00:32.034 --> 00:00:38.732
Red-eyed tree frogs live in North and South America.

6
00:00:38.733 --> 00:00:42.966
We like rain forests.

7
00:00:42.967 --> 00:00:46.425
Do you live in trees?

8
00:00:46.426 --> 00:00:51.286
We live in trees near water.

9
00:00:51.287 --> 00:00:55.605
Tadpoles live in the water.

10
00:00:55.606 --> 00:01:00.116
Tadpoles are baby frogs.

11
00:01:00.117 --> 00:01:02.911
What do you eat?

12
00:01:02.912 --> 00:01:08.102
Red-eyed tree frogs eat insects.

13
00:01:08.103 --> 00:01:14.074
We like crickets, moths, and flies.

14
00:01:14.075 --> 00:01:26.489
We catch prey with our long, sticky tongues.

15
00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:29.199
Where do you sleep?

16
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:34.837
We sleep on the bottoms of leaves.

17
00:01:34.838 --> 00:01:39.612
We can stick to the leaves!

18
00:01:39.613 --> 00:01:44.895
Do you have any enemies?

19
00:01:44.896 --> 00:01:50.188
Birds and snakes try to eat us.

20
00:01:50.189 --> 00:01:55.129
But our colors help protect us.

21
00:01:55.130 --> 00:02:05.247
Our green bodies blend in with leaves.

22
00:02:05.248 --> 00:02:10.805
What if an enemy sees you?

23
00:02:10.806 --> 00:02:16.223
Our red eyes can surprise enemies.

24
00:02:16.224 --> 00:02:19.523
Then we jump!

25
00:02:19.524 --> 00:02:28.563
Our orange legs also surprise enemies.

26
00:02:28.564 --> 00:02:33.430
Oh no! I see a snake!

27
00:02:33.431 --> 00:02:41.539
Good-bye, Red-eyed Tree Frog!
